    "ui.applaunch.itermmigrationhelper.some_profiles_have_unnecessary_key_mappings_which_may_interfere_with_win.b7520728": {
      "comment": "User-facing text in iTermMigrationHelper (indirect UI).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some profiles have unnecessary key mappings which may interfere with window tiling shortcuts added in macOS Sequoia. These were in the default profile for many years but are no longer needed. Remove the key mappings? It shouldn’t break anything, and it won’t modify the on-disk copy of the dynamic profile."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某些配置文件包含不再需要的按键映射，可能会干扰 macOS Sequoia 新增的窗口平铺快捷键。这些映射曾在默认配置文件中存在多年，现在已不再需要。要移除这些按键映射吗？这应该不会破坏任何功能，也不会修改动态配置文件的磁盘副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
