    "ui.settings.itermeditsnippetwindowcontroller.c_style_backslash_escaping_supports_a_bell_b.cbd2e61e": {
      "comment": "User-facing text in iTermEditSnippetWindowController (informativeText).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C-Style Backslash Escaping supports: \\a (bell), \\b (backspace), \\e (escape), \\n (newline), \\r (carriage return), \\t (tab), \\\\ (backslash), and \\x followed by two hex digits giving a single byte of UTF-8.\n\nUnescaped Literal Text does not have any special characters.\n\nBackward Compatibility Escaping, which is not recommended for new snippets, supports: \\n (newline), \\e (escape), \\a (bell), and \\t (tab).\n\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C 风格反斜杠转义支持：\\a（响铃）、\\b（退格）、\\e（Escape）、\\n（换行）、\\r（回车）、\\t（制表符）、\\\\（反斜杠），以及后跟两个十六进制数字的 \\x（表示一个 UTF-8 字节）。\n\n未转义的字面文本不包含任何特殊字符。\n\n不建议用于新片段的向后兼容转义支持：\\n（换行）、\\e（Escape）、\\a（响铃）和 \\t（制表符）。\n\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ui.settings.itermeditsnippetwindowcontroller.escaping.436b2c35": {
