    "ui.swift.aiterm.chatviewcontroller.link_this_chat_to_0_session_1_or.673a85d3": {
      "comment": "User-facing text in ChatViewController.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Link this chat to %1$@ session “%2$@”, or enable orchestration?**\n\nLinking gives the AI access to this %3$@ session subject to your per-call permission. **Orchestration** is an alternative mode where the AI can coordinate multiple sessions. It uses automatic safety checking and one-time per-session approval instead of fine-grained permissions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**将此聊天链接到%1$@会话“%2$@”，还是启用编排？**\n\n链接后，AI 可在逐次调用权限的约束下访问此%3$@会话。**编排**是另一种模式，AI 可在其中协调多个会话。它使用自动安全检查和每个会话的一次性批准，而不是细粒度权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ui.swift.aiterm.chatviewcontroller.link_this_session_to_ai_chat.cefc592e": {
