    "ui.swift.settings.importexport.the_following_will_be_erased_and_iterm2_will.41d5b4a2": {
      "comment": "User-facing text in ImportExport.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The following will be erased and iTerm2 will quit immediately:\n\n• Preferences (profiles, key bindings, arrangements, advanced settings)\n• Saved windows and sessions\n• Python API scripts and runtimes\n• Secure settings\n• The contents of ~/.iterm2 and ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2\n\nItems stored in the macOS Keychain (such as the AI API key and Password Manager entries) are not erased and must be removed manually from Keychain Access if you want them gone too. On systems with networked home directories, secure settings stored under /usr/local are written by an administrator and may also need to be removed manually.\n\nThis cannot be undone.\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下内容将被抹掉，iTerm2 随即退出：\n\n• 设置（配置文件、按键绑定、窗口布局、高级设置）\n• 已存储的窗口和会话\n• Python API 脚本和运行时\n• 安全设置\n• ~/.iterm2 和 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2 中的内容\n\nmacOS 钥匙串中存储的项目（如 AI API 密钥和密码管理器条目）不会被抹掉；若也要移除，必须在“钥匙串访问”中手动删除。对于使用网络主目录的系统，存储在 /usr/local 下的安全设置由管理员写入，可能也需要手动移除。\n\n此操作无法撤销。\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
